[FEN "8/8/8/8/8/5k2/R7/6K1 w - - 0 1"]
[LineName "06. Final exam (6/6)"]
[LineDescription "Cut off, opposition, check on the edge: the rook mate."]

{King and rook again.} 1. Ra4 Kg3 2. Kf1 Kf3 3. Ke1 Ke3 4. Rh4 Kd3 5. Kf2 Kc2 6.
Rh3 {[%also Ke2,Ke3]} 6... Kb2 7. Ke1 {[%also Ke2,Re3]} 7... Kc2 8. Ke2 {[%also
Re3,Rf3,Rg3]} 8... Kb1 9. Kd1 {[%also Kd2,Kd3]} 9... Kb2 10. Kd2 Ka1 11. Kc1
{[%also Kc2,Rb3]} 11... Ka2 12. Rc3 {[%also Rd3,Re3,Rf3,Rg3,Kc2]} 12... Ka1 13.
Ra3# {Checkmate in the corner! The rook gives check and your king covers the
other squares.} *
